{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":17,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-8","storyName":"登台致礼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"剧团长复盘地块上此前发生的一切，大肆宣讲他关于“死亡”的美学。而卢西恩表明来意——再一次杀死他。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"next":17,"characters":["卢西恩","剧团长","小卢西恩"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act43side/m_sys_act43side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_bg_62_g5_duelscene.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"破坏了你的演出，我深表遗憾。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"如若你是指自己解决了那个名叫莫伊拉的孩子......那我应当谴责你不合时宜的谦逊，卢西恩。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"以你之颖悟，应当猜到了故事原本的结局。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"一桩五年前的旧案，一场恰是时候的天灾，风暴与迟来的审判同时降临在这个地块......","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"而那个原本游离于故事之外的札拉克，慢慢走到了舞台中央，杀死所有背负着罪孽的人。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"卢西恩","text":"尔后，她将意识到自己的所作所为不过是出于一种虚妄的执念，她将清醒，她将万念俱灰，她将审判最后一人——","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"multiline","name":"卢西恩","end":"true","text":"她自己。","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"而你呢？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你是剧本中偶然经过的信使，你是剧组里无足轻重的新人，你离核心矛盾如此遥远，却最终成了所有线索的收束。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#3$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"“偶然”越出人意料，那无从更改的“必然”上演时，越是震撼人心......这便是戏剧的魅力，你我早已无数次领略。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"所以啊，你并未破坏什么，你只是在为演出增色。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......就像你曾在剧团的所作所为。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我途经这种种惨剧，只是为了走向你。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#12$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"哈哈，当然。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"拍卖会上的一个剧团印记，并不足以让你确认我的存在，对吧？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"幸好。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"时隔多年，“死亡”，抑或说“毁灭”，依然是你善用的桥段，钟爱的结局。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"孩子啊孩子，我多么希望，你由衷认可它的美。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"由衷认可吗......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"谈不上，剧团长。我只是比谁都熟悉它。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我演过很多戏，我杀过很多人，我的双手满是血腥。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这是我幼时便接受的教育，这是你灌输给我的人生。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你是我最好的学生，卢西恩。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"在最后的高潮戏到来前，且让我们复盘此前的演出。你我都对这个流程再熟悉不过。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长微笑着向卢西恩优雅鞠躬，他尾巴卷起的权杖遥指向越来越逼近的天灾云，像是一支蘸墨的笔......","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉的景象在卢西恩眼前展开。他知道自己无从拒绝，不，他为此而来。","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩轻轻颔首。","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"那么，首先是道尔顿。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"background","id":62},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_62_i01_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":63},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":64},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"fi","fadetime":"2","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"对这个行尸走肉般的中年演员而言，这场戏原本无足轻重。","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"贡献几分难得的清醒，调动仅剩的已成本能的技巧，背诵不多的台词，挨到导演喊停，换取足以支撑下一个长夜的酒资......","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他从未哀悼那个因自己而死的女演员，从未缅怀意气风发的曾经，甚至不会因如今的潦倒失意有所羞惭。","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你操纵了他。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"诚然，没有我的介入，他不会主动找来那把被调换了的刀，并交到你的手中......","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"可我并未命令他将胸膛迎向刀锋。","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你与他对戏的那一刻，他已然清醒，已然知晓自己身处怎样的危险之中。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"卢西恩，戏剧到电影的转换，丝毫没有妨碍你自如地挥洒自己的天赋。","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你的表演唤醒了他的记忆，你让他想起了自己曾是一个多么优秀的演员——沉浸其中，赋予虚拟的喜怒哀乐以真实。","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"那一刻，“信使”入了戏，“杜邦爵士”也彻底被破产的可能性扭曲了内心......","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他必须掩盖真相，他必须拼尽全力杀死眼前人，不及思索刀锋反而伤到自己的可能......","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你当时就在他的对面，没有人比你更清楚，那一刻，他的愤怒与恐惧多么有感染力。","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"作为谢幕演出，近乎完美。","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"是啊，近在咫尺的死亡，反而激起了他被酒精麻痹许久的胜负欲，他尽情表演，意兴盎然！","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":88},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_62_i03","style":"cg","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.2","layer":"1","id":89},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_62_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.2","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"还有迈克尔与玛丽昂。","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"拈花惹草的演员与精明的服装师被双双吊在拍摄现场，他们那可笑的私情就这么被晾晒在所有人面前。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他们的结合可耻而滑稽，他们放纵自己的欲望，醉心于钻营，互相鄙夷却又互相利用......","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"在他们身上从内到外看不见一丝真实，那个迈克尔，甚至连耳朵和尾巴都是伪造的。","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他们的死毫无价值，除了为那个摄影助理提供了一则可以兜售的八卦。","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"可是，卢西恩，你查看过现场，那只猫也舔舐过此地残留的情绪——","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你应当清楚，当莫伊拉敲响这扇门，当死亡的脚步声逼近，在那不容思索的片刻间，他们各自做了什么。","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"泪痕。","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"唔，有趣的细节。","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"迈克尔的眼角留有泪痕，“洛克菲勒”三兄弟的任意一位都未曾向“杜邦夫人”表露过这般深情......","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......这柄消防斧原本是砍向玛丽昂的。","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"迈克尔护住了她，将自身的要害暴露在了利刃之下。","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"在生命的最后关头，这对前一刻仍在互相攻讦的男女，下意识的反应是守护彼此。","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"0.5","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_62_i03","id":110},{"type":"image","id":111},{"type":"bgeffect","id":112},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_bg_62_g5_duelscene.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":113},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"他们确认了对彼此的，真情。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这本身并不值得歌颂。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#12$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你说得没错，我的孩子。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"只是，观众已经落座，他们期待在这灯光与声响围筑成的幻梦中看到什么？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"钻营者到头来一无所有，纵欲者终被欲望反噬？当然，这是最顺理成章的编排，用以展示一些无聊的大道理。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#3$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"他们何曾想过，并不值得歌颂的真情也足以让人意外。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"这两人又何曾想过，他们有那么一刻，会为彼此动容。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"死亡赋予他们可能？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"死亡赋予他们可能。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"当然，还有莫伊拉——在你现身之前，我最看好的孩子。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"background","id":142},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":143},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_62_i04_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":144},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"莫伊拉因另一人的死亡而重建了信念。","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"那人的名字、生平、饮食习惯与标志性的微笑，凄惨的死状与逍遥法外的群凶......莫伊拉铭记“劳拉”的一切。","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她悲恸，她愤怒，她质疑，她仇恨，她油然而生的一切情绪，点燃了一段被尘封的过往，也点燃了她自己。","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她主导了整场演出。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"剧团长，你何苦低估自己在其中的作用？","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"是你加入一纸飞页，将一段本不存在的过往强塞进了她的脑海，将“劳拉”带进了她的人生。","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"唔，那又如何？","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你看看莫伊拉——","id":157},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":159},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_62_i05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.2","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她在起舞。","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"卢西恩，你是她当时的舞伴，应该对此深有感触——","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她并未像猩红剧团的孩子们一样，从小接受“白英花”的训练，可你看她的舞步、她的形体、她脸上的哭泣与微笑......","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她在表演一种生活，抑或营造一种真实......或者，她再无局限，她可以是任何人。","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"她将在千百样人生中起舞，永不落幕，直到躯壳与心神再也无法负载这种种情感。","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"又或者，她终将遇见你，或其他偏爱真相的愚人，在某个夜晚恍然梦醒，结束自己的生命。","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"无论结局为何，她的灵魂都曾丰盈而充实。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"无论结局为何......她都不再只是一个从开拓区来的举目无亲的小道具师，空无所依的札拉克。","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"0.5","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"image","id":175},{"type":"bgeffect","id":176},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_bg_62_g5_duelscene.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":177},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你还是如此健谈，剧团长。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我已有许久不曾见你这般富有激情地点评他人。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......自你之后，卢西恩。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"我不否认我施加在莫伊拉身上的影响，我给了她一些激励，就像我曾经给过你的一样。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"我的孩子，你忘了吗？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"如若不是对表演的渴望，你早已死去。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"当你在天灾中流离失所，当你失去家园与双亲，当你在巨大的古堡与陌生的同伴间迷失，你说——","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"background","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":199},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":200},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_pic_rogue_1_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":201},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_bg_24_RL_castlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":202},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"......","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"只有当我是剧中角色时......","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"我的孤独才能被消除......","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"我有自己的归宿。","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"5","id":212},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_blackmask","layer":"2","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"image","id":217},{"type":"bgeffect","id":218},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_bg_62_g5_duelscene.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":219},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你以此为寄托，你因此得救。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你与莫伊拉——你们都是天生的演员，靠凭空创造的悲喜滋养自我。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"无人可以忽视你们的光芒！","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"而孩子，死亡是你们共同的良师。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"还记得吗？那时你深陷瓶颈，表演上再难寸进，而周遭的一切无法给予你更多体悟......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你毫不犹豫地将源石扎进了自己的喉咙。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你感受到了死亡，那是最无可争议的绝境！","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它将恐惧、嫉妒、悲伤、愤怒、耻辱、贪婪......万千于你而言太过陌生的情感带给了你，它让你的心在观照万千后，成为了明镜。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它赋予你解构权威的立场、摧毁一切的决意、无止境的夜与不停止的歌......","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它让不起眼的卢西恩，成为了耀眼的——猩红血钻！","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"“猩红血钻”......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"久远的称呼。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"孩子，想想道尔顿、迈克尔与玛丽昂、劳拉与莫伊拉......看看那些在天灾中挣扎的人们，还有你自己......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你说得没错，死亡仍是我善用的桥段，钟爱的结局。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#5$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"可我绝不视之为“毁灭”。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它让伟大者自毁名节，让苦修者打破戒律，让圣洁者走入泥淖，让英雄满怀卑劣！","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它让失意者重新振奋，让缄默者呼号理想，让自私者流露哪怕一刻的真情，让胆怯者超然忘我！","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它让先驱找到登高的台阶，让远视者敢于放手一搏，让自诩灯塔之人成为灯塔！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#3$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它培育意义，也浇灌缺陷；它巩固真实，也喂养虚假；它让垂死的血肉成为花朵，让本应消失无痕的得到铭刻！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它是无从排解的苦，也是盎然的灵感！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"它是戏剧的因与果，魂与肉，驱动创造的伟力，万千主义、形式与探索无从逃离的“律”与“绳”......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"万物的归宿！","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"剧团长看向卢西恩，微笑依然挂在他的嘴边。风沙正急，而他不为所动。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"孩子，它也是你我重逢的契机。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clapsolo","volume":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#12$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"遗憾，掌声过于寥落。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"站在你对面的，只有我......也只能是我。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"嘈杂的声响从四面八方传来，卢西恩仔细地听着。","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"天灾在肆虐，Miss.Christine一反常态地低啸，相识不久的同伴在惊惶奔走，无望地求救......","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"如剧团长所说，死亡正在上演，从几出循序渐进的重场戏，到整个舞台俯拾皆是。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你说死亡是你我重逢的契机......我无比赞同。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"所以，我不会放过这次机会。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"请允许我在您复盘完之后，发表一些自己的见解——你我都对这个流程再熟悉不过。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":289},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":290},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_avg_prts_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_prts_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":291,"musicid":1},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_land_impact","volume":"1","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"风暴折断了一截拍摄用的钢架，火星四溅，两人附近的一块地毯被点燃，火焰紧贴着卢西恩的身侧跳动。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"但卢西恩毫不在意，他紧盯着面前的人，脱帽颔首。","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"background","id":302},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_062cg_phantom_front","layer":"2","id":303},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_062cg_phantom_bihand","layer":"1","id":304},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_62_i08.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":305},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","duration":"30","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"自你现身，你为何只字未提我对你不止一次的背叛？","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"（微笑）","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"因为那并不重要，因为你还是你，孩子。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"迷狂又清醒，出走又归来......饱经曲折后的重逢是多么难能可贵，一切龃龉都可被岁月原谅。","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"是这样吗？","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我曾以为，剧团是你的笔，你的网，混乱的世道和在演出中寻求慰藉的观众为你张目，所以无人能从你手中逃离。","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"所以更早的时候，我与暮落，还有剧作家的计划失败了。","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那时我年轻、稚拙而自负，我们自以为看破了剧团的真相，可精心安排的脱逃，到头来成了你演出的一环。","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"最终，暮落带着对你的恐惧继续逃遁，而我重新走向你。","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你回到了我的身边。","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"也是自那一刻起，你决意学习我所有的技巧，熟谙剧团的一切，然后瓦解它。","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"以死亡了断死亡，以毁灭终结毁灭。","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"“白英花”“刀舞”“影子”......那些曾予你教诲的老师们，尽皆死于你手。","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......还有我。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我犹记得自己当时破裂张狂的歌喉，以及刀锋刺入你胸膛的温热，我自以为毁掉了整个猩红剧团......","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"哪怕做到这种程度，我依然失败了，不是吗？","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你没有死去。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"因为死亡常在，而戏剧永恒。","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"永恒，是啊，那之后，我花费了更多时间，研究你的作品——包括我自己。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我穷尽你的永恒，像一个鲁钝的信徒。","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"最终，我走到了这里。再一次身临你引以为傲的戏剧，盛大的死亡、悲剧与美学......","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"直到此刻，天灾为你我搭好最后的舞台。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"剧团长，尊敬的老师，或者更准确些，我应当称呼你为，“酒神”。","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我将毁掉你的一切。","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩解开了喉间的抑制器，暴露的源石结晶闪耀着，像是为即将到来的歌唱雀跃。","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"他向着剧团长深深鞠躬，云层在他身后倾倒。","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":345},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":346},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"bgeffect","id":350},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"background","id":353},{"type":"image","id":354}],"characters":["卢西恩","剧团长","小卢西恩"]}